  "shared_passage": "<p>Near my home there is a big city park. It has tall trees, a small lake and a playground for children.</p><p>In the morning many people walk or run there. Old people sit on benches and talk. Children play on the swings and the slide.</p><p>There is a little cafe next to the lake. You can buy ice cream and juice. In spring the flowers are beautiful and colourful.</p><p>On Sundays my family goes to the park after lunch. We take a ball and play for one hour. Then we feed the ducks near the water.</p><p>The park is clean and quiet. I feel happy when I go there.</p>",
